    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Oann</strong> is a single-player horror shooter with an intense and mysterious story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delivers an intense action experience without compromising the immersion of a compelling narrative. All mechanics are relatively simple, but since there is no difficulty selection, the game can be considered challenging, as combat is aggressive and requires practice to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thomas is a geologist on a routine job when, mysteriously, monsters start appearing, trying to kill him. What initially seems like an unexpected nightmare soon reveals itself to be part of a larger plan when he discovers instructions to find someone named Oann and save him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find items, story notes, and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina to dodge enemy attacks during combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rage doses to obliterate enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set bear traps to restrain your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignite areas to control fights against multiple enemies using gasoline canisters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521990/extras/ceee329e9343776add132702e559bfb4.avif?t=1755525843\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span><strong>INCLUDED WITH PURCHASE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete single-player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates for bug fixes</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Oann</strong> is a single-player horror shooter with an intense and mysterious story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delivers an intense action experience without compromising the immersion of a compelling narrative. All mechanics are relatively simple, but since there is no difficulty selection, the game can be considered challenging, as combat is aggressive and requires practice to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thomas is a geologist on a routine job when, mysteriously, monsters start appearing, trying to kill him. What initially seems like an unexpected nightmare soon reveals itself to be part of a larger plan when he discovers instructions to find someone named Oann and save him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find items, story notes, and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina to dodge enemy attacks during combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rage doses to obliterate enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set bear traps to restrain your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignite areas to control fights against multiple enemies using gasoline canisters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521990/extras/ceee329e9343776add132702e559bfb4.avif?t=1755525843\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span><strong>INCLUDED WITH PURCHASE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete single-player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates for bug fixes</p></li></ul>",
